<p>Hello <%= @resource.first_name %>!</p>

<% if @resource.try(:unconfirmed_email?) %>
  <p>The email address for your Edify account is being changed to <%= @resource.unconfirmed_email %>.</p>
<% else %>
  <p>The email address for your Edify account was just changed to <%= @resource.email %>. We're writing to your old address to let you know.</p>
<% end %>

<p>If you made this change, there's nothing more to do.</p>

<p>
  If you didn't, someone else may have access to your account, and password reset emails now go to the new address.
  <% if ::EdifyConfig.support_email_address %>
    Write to <%= mail_to ::EdifyConfig.support_email_address %> right away so we can restore your access.
  <% else %>
    Ask your bishopric to contact the Edify administrators right away.
  <% end %>
</p>
